{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If visible object, approach and grab it, process and move to location. If not, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
